    {
      "id": "ddf423c1-4ff3-4a0f-a8fb-76049088d366",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe como a palavra se liga a guardar comida e localizar itens do dia a dia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "aec8cc81-4322-44dd-8ad7-2312584c4506",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>la nevera</strong> é a palavra para a geladeira quando o assunto é guardar comida, bebida ou sobras da semana.</p><p>Ela costuma aparecer junto de itens de cozinha e de rotina prática.</p><p>Exemplo: <strong>La leche está en la nevera.</strong></p><p>Aqui, a frase usa a palavra para localizar uma coisa comum do dia a dia.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d7403c82-60e5-4c46-8fa0-ac6890f085a0",
      "title": "Escute e observe a palavra em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "399bf8dd-0dad-4dc7-bf83-b1920243f8e9",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe o aparelho.</p><p><strong>la lavadora</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>a máquina de lavar</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bb0fae406fc94dde8637837459868bbe_b06-la-lavadora.png?Expires=1794099608&Signature=taVUKJ2ht1a1ta2hI~pqL4BWDEM-Ppkw2yY8Ek6TFD0psiKPLWkSPgIsERD0Gua5ETDQrror0f8~pZO5Uub467UnPUBoNydpxvnaS5NOl0ePvhsZ5kcEt0uWDBh2FiNzyii2bChDxFQ8Wwcq4PZHCKwcw5jAxUtUipBn5Mi4E~bykzObrD2nNd~PIa4oiu9ZjprLDGPCID1pMiVfQiA2nrN6MJN~bdgBm5naHb3Z-Ug50r8DNcRYah~9~lXiAF8oZACSAR7KJOefLcJJdUbdwYBvnUcOP6DRRGq7LknzkHuf2aYDNAeJngsCX-EyGc47mkplk57pbE1pGAuosjZ2jQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c2f5834dcc924cc6a4779a10b74a5c5d_b06-la-lavadora.mp3?Expires=1794099608&Signature=WNyyzLdwqZ--A47zHbBT4uFRhXRfrFg8gqqo4pGfUY77XV3UrUNXTftYfdyxXvI11o-zNfW5LIyxAB4o1uRqQtqSB56Q8Fgh7rL3bcv7~j-XZf-qNkyG2WhyqWjonhufcXQEUwK9KjnvJjoejPO4PABCEEWdtrmIi2g0VisrFVlt0LxRod3NevOtH-3Mej~LSuQhPtfvRJt8LL4PQTprhaikzWDS2F6lc~nYpkRbZI0Zg5tX8CUfM1rj6X2M9JLB1qWoKp76Tla-llBWQmNP-qYO022TCDffuCeh-1Z9vAAhh5GXpCtLABb4fl3ZBkKfvJUPzU8b1GE2mx9qmY2fBA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
